  "commonFailures": [
    "Rule 2, all six writers: lending quick-take A turned \"Don't lead with the payback date\" into \"No/Skip the payback talk\". A shrinks to its -2 extreme. Fix: keep \"don't lead with the payback date\" (for example \"Send what I can lose. Payback talk can wait.\").",
    "Rule 2, voice frames that change what is measured: Oracle \"The cards advise…\" (feedback_style stance asks for the cards' advice, not the person's preference) and \"on an empty night\" (support_capacity scene loses the exhausted condition). Keep the fortune flavor out of the condition being tested.",
    "Rule 2, specific details that narrow the option to one kind of event or motive: Fun \"took the birthday person to lunch\" and \"skipped the pricey dinner\" (the scene is any above-budget plan); Call me out \"Not knowing anyone is the point\" (novelty becomes wanting to be socially alone); Call me out closeness B \"Plenty\" (both poles now mean lots of shared time).",
    "Rule 3, uneven charm or emotional loading on one pole: wedding_budget A with \"Everyone I love\" / \"All our people there\" against a bare B (Fun, Oracle); Call me out H05 jabs (\"It won't.\", \"Said it with a straight face\") only on the B options; Call me out standards prompt using a harmless plane-clap example that makes trusting the ick look petty.",
    "Rules 2 and 4 on feedback_style: Scenario \"Hyped it up\" pushes +1 toward +2. Kind labels the poles \"honest answer\" and \"mostly kind\", which names this tag's never-list traits and flatters one side.",
    "Rule 9 (minor): Oracle betrayal_line keeps the bank.js \"The closeness.\" / \"The hiding.\" pair, both starting with \"The\".",
    "Clean across all writers: every scene keeps a real \"last time\" frame (rule 5); option order and null/none options match bank.js, including celebration_budget -2,-1,+2,+1 (rule 2 order); emotion-coded options keep guilt, worry, sting, resentment and longing (rule 6); no gendered or teen-unsafe lines outside the 18+ tags (rule 7); no em dashes; all options are 10 words or fewer and all prompts 20 or fewer (rule 8); all 48 sealed checks pass except Call me out H05."
  ]
